mako: mako (a lightweight notification daemon for Wayland)
mako: mako is a lightweight notification daemon for Wayland,
mako: tested with Sway. It implements the FreeDesktop Notifications
mako: Specification over D-Bus, with support for custom match rules,
mako: renderers, icons, animations, and a simple mako.config file.
mako:
mako: Also includes makoctl, a command-line tool to control mako
mako: (list, dismiss, pause and resume notifications).
